1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:07,703
Autonomous trading agents can make financial decisions faster than
humans can supervise them.

2
00:00:07,703 --> 00:00:11,705
But an agent should not be the only judge of its own thesis.

3
00:00:12,255 --> 00:00:16,145
Dissent is an adversarial audit protocol for AI trading agents.

4
00:00:16,145 --> 00:00:20,961
A client submits a thesis, and the exact conditions that would prove it
wrong.

5
00:00:20,961 --> 00:00:25,222
Those conditions are committed on NEAR before any attacker sees them.

6
00:00:25,772 --> 00:00:28,621
Eight isolated specialists attack the thesis.

7
00:00:28,621 --> 00:00:32,862
They see the committed conditions, but never each other's findings.

8
00:00:32,862 --> 00:00:39,192
Every condition is assessed exactly once, and Section B searches for
risks beyond the committed set.

9
00:00:39,742 --> 00:00:46,939
The roster spans seven model families across two vendors, with an open-
weight model and a documented TEE waiver.

10
00:00:46,939 --> 00:00:50,794
The certificate records that deviation instead of hiding it.

11
00:00:51,344 --> 00:00:54,709
Dissent also pays for its own intelligence.

12
00:00:54,709 --> 00:01:00,423
A dedicated agent wallet signs an x402 payment for each A01 and A02
call.

13
00:01:00,423 --> 00:01:08,328
The facilitator shim settles the transfer on-chain in test USDC, then
forwards the inference request.

14
00:01:08,878 --> 00:01:15,763
This is the Agent Economy: an autonomous agent that can pay for the
services it consumes, without a human in the loop.

15
00:01:16,313 --> 00:01:19,351
Evidence is re-fetched through fixed adapters.

16
00:01:19,351 --> 00:01:23,512
A missing source becomes unverifiable, never a negative result.

17
00:01:23,512 --> 00:01:29,919
The deterministic adjudicator evaluates coverage, verified evidence, and
unresolved disagreement.

18
00:01:29,919 --> 00:01:31,636
There is no majority vote.

19
00:01:32,186 --> 00:01:34,835
The result is TRADE, REFUSE, or ABSTAIN.

20
00:01:34,835 --> 00:01:41,125
The certificate preserves the complete coverage table, accepted
findings, and minority dissent.

21
00:01:41,675 --> 00:01:44,496
The certificate is hashed and anchored on NEAR.

22
00:01:44,496 --> 00:01:48,397
Anyone can recompute the hash and verify it against the registry.

23
00:01:48,947 --> 00:01:51,283
Dissent is not just a service.

24
00:01:51,283 --> 00:01:53,386
It is its own first client.

25
00:01:53,386 --> 00:02:01,640
It originated a thesis, audited it, executed it via its vault, and paid
for its own AI compute using x402.

26
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:04,677
It is a self-sustaining economic actor.

27
00:02:05,227 --> 00:02:10,216
Here is the historical proprietary run: the vault transfer, the Tidepool
settlement,

28
00:02:10,216 --> 00:02:13,482
and the execution receipt preserved in the certificate.

29
00:02:14,031 --> 00:02:18,907
The same public verifier returns VERIFIED, with execution readiness
EXECUTED.

30
00:02:19,457 --> 00:02:21,307
Dissent doesn't just judge autonomous agents.

31
00:02:21,307 --> 00:02:23,206
It is one.

